# k.words/shards/ah: senses of the words from "ahead" to "ahem" (first letters "ah").
# sources: wordnet 3.1 (Princeton WordNet 3.1; words chosen with frequency-words 2018, the 20,000 most frequent, and the common things of tools/coverage.mjs)
